{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":14.64},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.68,"end":30.96},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.32,"end":46.24}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.52,"text":"最後條件把授權結果與 NOT C 結合。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.24,"end":5.6,"text":"警報開啟時，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.68,"end":6.72,"text":"NOT C 為假，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7,"end":9.68,"text":"不論 A、B 如何門都關閉。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.4,"end":12.24,"text":"把授權運算括起來，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.4,"end":14.64,"text":"能清楚表達這項否決權。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.68,"end":17.04,"text":"讓兩個授權皆真，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.28,"end":18.32,"text":"再切換警報。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":19.04,"end":21.92,"text":"換成 OR 且只有一個授權為真，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.48,"end":24.56,"text":"確認警報仍阻止進入。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.599,"end":27.92,"text":"對 (A OR B) AND NOT C，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":28.32,"end":30.96,"text":"C = 1 強制什麼結果？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.32,"end":34.72,"text":"對 (A OR B) AND NOT C，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35.12,"end":37.84,"text":"C = 1 強制什麼結果？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.28,"end":42.96,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":43.68,"end":46.24,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}